 integrity of the democratic process by administering and supporting secure and accessible county elections.</span></p></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mte9zzux" class="_WRichTextNewSkin_vcky1_163 _supportTableDesign_vcky1_54 builder-root builder-root comp-mte9zzux _wrichtext_aqg9v_1 wrichtext wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h2>What Does a County Commissioner Do?</h2></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mtea00ck" class="_WRichTextNewSkin_vcky1_163 _supportTableDesign_vcky1_54 builder-root builder-root comp-mtea00ck _wrichtext_aqg9v_1 wrichtext wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p>County commissioners are key members of the Commissioners Court, serving as both legislative and executive officers. They provide essential oversight for county government operations, ensuring that vital local services are delivered efficiently and responsibly to all residents.</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div id="comp-mthjeo9c" class="_root_1vtez_1 builder-root builder-root comp-mthjeo9c image" style="--original-aspect-ratio:1.5010141987829615"><div class="_image3_1vtez_5" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mthjeo9c"><div class="_imageLayer_1vtez_20" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mthjeo9c"><wow-image id="img-comp-mthjeo9c" data-image-info="{&quot;alignType&quot;:&quot;center&quot;,&quot;containerId&quot;:&quot;comp-mthjeo9c&quot;,&quot;encoding&quot;:&quot;AVIF&quot;,&quot;imageData&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;County Budget &amp; Taxation.jpg&quot;,&quot;uri&quot;:&quot;356328_c309a952bb094b28b9152a776647175e~mv2.jpg&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:493,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;dataItem-mthjphue&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;County Budget &amp; Taxation.jpg&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Builder.Image&quot;,&quot;metaData&quot;:{&quot;isHidden&quot;:false,&quot;sig&quot;:&quot;qjt-24&quot;,&quot;schemaVersion&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;isPreset&quot;:false},&quot;width&quot;:740,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://static.wixstatic.com/media/356328_c